eration of this site. For all other types of cookies we need your permission. This website uses different types of cookies. Some cookies are placed by third party services that appear on our pages. You can at any time change or withdraw your consent from the cookie declaration on our website. Please state your consent ID and date when you contact us regarding your consent. For more information about the use of cookies at TU/e you can visit: https://www.tue.nl/en/storage/disclaimer Do not sell or share my personal information Deny Allow selection Customize Allow all Skip to content Menu Close the menu Menu Eindhoven University of Technology Education Research Our university Working at TU/e News and Events Impact × search Search Nederlands NL Search Working at TU/e Vacancies Scientific Staff Scientific Staff Academic Perspectives Irène Curie Program Learning & Development Personal Grants Partner Career Support Program Scientific Staff Vacancies Support Staff Support Staff Learning & Development Support Staff Vacancies PhD EngD At TU/e Why TU/e Conditions of Employment Application Process Support for Internationals Home Working at TU/e Vacancies Vacancies Directly to Create job alert Login to (re)view your application(s) Login as an employee to view internal vacancies Search term Vacancy for: Professional staff Professional staff Scientific staff Position Policy and staff Legal Education Lecturer Associate Professor Managerial positions Engineering Doctorate (EngD) Communications Technical and laboratory Postdoctorate Finance Other academic staff Support IT Assistant Professor Full Professor HR PhD Department or Service Communication Expertise Center Education and Student Affairs Research Support and Valorization General Affairs Equipment and Prototype Center Department of Industrial Design Department of Chemical Engineering and Chemistry Department of Electrical Engineering Finance and Control Department of Biomedical Engineering Department of Applied Physics and Scie