    "https://tue.varbi.com/en/what:subscribe/": {
      "title": "Job Alert",
      "description": "Job Alert Log in to your Varbi account Swedish Norwegian Danish Finnish German Dutch Chinese (BETA) Polish French Romanian Norwegian (nynorsk) Job Alert Do you want to stay informed about new job openings? Set up a job alert and receive daily or weekly job vacancies that match your preferences. A job alert is valid for two years, but you can unsubscribe at any time. (You can set up multiple job alerts.) Position category Choose Full Professor Associate Professor Assistant Professor Postdoctorate PhD Engineering Doctorate (EngD) Assistant, Associate Professor Associate, Full Professor Assistant, Associate, Full Professor PhD, Postdoctorate Lecturer Communications Education Finance HR IT Legal Support Managerial positions Policy and staff Technical and laboratory Other academic staff How often do you wish to receive emails? Daily Weekly Email * I agree that Grade Varbi AB stores the above information and sends relevant job opportunities by email. I can unsubscribe via the link in any job alert email and I have read how Grade Varbi handles my personal data in Varbi's Data Privacy Policy . Job Alert - RSS Subscribe to jobs in RSS format https://tue.varbi.com/what:rssfeed/ Remove Job Alert Enter your email here Remove Return to job vacancies Grade Varbi Recruit recruitment system Cookies Terms Data privacy policy Accessibility statement × Modal title We use cookies for login, improved user experience, share links and in some cases marketing and collection of statistics. Accept all cookies Accept only necessary Read more about our cookies here ×"
    },
